doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22100871
abstract: >-
  Acquisition and ingest software for the spin-noise network: a TopSpin
  2.x-4.x Jython orchestrator that records pulse-free nuclear spin-noise
  bundles on any Bruker spectrometer, a stdlib-only Python 3 uploader with
  a built-in bundle validator, a JSON-Schema metadata contract, and a
  Cloudflare Worker + R2 ingest endpoint. Collected bundles map the
  temperature-contrast law of circuit-spin coupling across the community's
  probe fleet and bank spin-noise-limited records for fundamental-sensitivity
  and dark-matter (CASPEr-style) analyses.
keywords:
  - NMR
  - spin noise
  - radiation damping
  - fundamental sensitivity
  - axion dark matter
  - TopSpin
